@{
    Layout = "_NoHeaderLayout";
}

<div class="container ltr mt-3">

    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p>Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>Majesta</strong> collects, uses, discloses, and protects your personal information when you use our app, integrated with Facebook's platform.</p>

    <p>By using our app, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree with the practices described in this Privacy Policy, please do not use our app.</p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

    <h3>a. Personal Information Provided by You</h3>
    <p>When you use our app, we may collect personal information directly from you. This includes, but is not limited to:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Your name</li>
        <li>Your email address</li>
        <li>Your Facebook profile information (such as your public profile, friend list, email, etc.), as allowed by Facebook’s permissions</li>
        <li>Any other information you choose to provide to us voluntarily</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>b. Automatically Collected Information</h3>
    <p>We may collect information automatically as you use the app, including:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Your device’s IP address</li>
        <li>Browser type and version</li>
        <li>Time zone setting</li>
        <li>App usage data and activity</li>
        <li>Facebook ID, if available through the Facebook SDK</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>c. Facebook Data</h3>
    <p>Through the Facebook platform, we may collect information you provide or share through your Facebook profile based on the permissions you grant. This data may include:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Public profile</li>
        <li>Friends list (with your consent)</li>
        <li>Email address</li>
        <li>Other data you explicitly consent to sharing with us via Facebook</li>
    </ul>

    <p>We follow Facebook's privacy and data policies when handling any of this data. You can view Facebook's privacy policy <a href="https://www.facebook.com/policy.php" target="_blank">here</a>.</p>

    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use the information we collect for the following purposes:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>To operate and provide services through our app</li>
        <li>To personalize and improve your experience within the app</li>
        <li>To communicate with you (e.g., notifications, updates, marketing)</li>
        <li>To analyze app usage and improve the performance of our app</li>
        <li>To prevent fraud and enhance security</li>
        <li>To comply with legal obligations or enforce our terms of service</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. How We Share Your Information</h2>
    <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. However, we may share your data in the following situations:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>With Facebook:</strong> When you use our app integrated with Facebook, your data may be shared with Facebook as required by their terms of service and policies.</li>
        <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> We may share your data with trusted third-party service providers who assist us in delivering our services (e.g., hosting, data analytics). These third parties are bound by confidentiality agreements.</li>
        <li><strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> We may disclose your data to comply with a legal obligation or protect the rights, property, or safety of Majesta, our users, or others.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
    <p>We take reasonable measures to protect your personal information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. We use encryption, firewalls, and secure server infrastructure to safeguard your data.</p>

    <p>However, no method of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

    <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
    <p>We retain your personal information for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this Privacy Policy or as required by law. You can request that we delete your information at any time by contacting us at <a href="mailto:info@Majesta.org">info@Majesta.org</a>.</p>

    <h2>6. Your Rights and Choices</h2>
    <p>Depending on your location, you may have the following rights regarding your personal information:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Access:</strong> You can request access to your personal data.</li>
        <li><strong>Correction:</strong> You can request correction of any incorrect personal data.</li>
        <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> You can request the deletion of your personal data.</li>
        <li><strong>Opt-Out:</strong> You can opt out of receiving marketing communications from us.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@Majesta.org">info@Majesta.org</a>.</p>

    <h2>7. Third-Party Links and Services</h2>
    <p>Our app may contain links to third-party websites or services that are not owned or controlled by us. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these third parties, and we encourage you to read their privacy policies.</p>

    <h2>8. Children’s Privacy</h2>
    <p>Our app is not intended for children under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe we have collected data from a child, please contact us, and we will take steps to delete the information.</p>

    <h2>9. Compliance with Meta’s Platform Terms</h2>
    <p>Our app complies with <a href="https://www.facebook.com/policy.php" target="_blank">Meta's Privacy Policy</a> and their <a href="https://www.facebook.com/terms.php" target="_blank">Platform Terms</a>. We handle your Facebook data in accordance with these policies.</p>

    <h2>10. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date. We encourage you to review this Privacy Policy periodically.</p>

    <h2>11. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us at:</p>

    <p>
        <strong>Majesta</strong><br>
        Email: <a href="mailto:info@Majesta.org">info@Majesta.org</a>
    </p>

</div>
